  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Bill Frauenhofer said CHIPS R&D incentives would support breakthroughs in compute and communication infrastructures for next-generation AI capabilities. He described indium phosphide photonics as essential for high-speed data transmission within AI systems, telecommunications, and advanced networks. He said accelerating R&D for domestic photonics, novel memory architectures, advanced packaging, substrates, and other technologies would give American industries bandwidth and energy efficiency to scale complex AI workloads.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Bill Frauenhofer said CHIPS R&D incentives would support breakthroughs in compute and communication infrastructures for next-generation AI capabilities.",
